uanto a los que se apartan a sus caminos torcidos,","poem":1},{"text":"Yahvé los llevará con los obreros de la iniquidad.","poem":2},{"text":"La paz sea con Israel.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/spa_blm/PSA/125.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/spa_blm/PSA/126.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/spa_blm/PSA/124.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":5}